# C-c fresh preparation inventory

Read-only preparation design from actual06's accepted fixed authority and the approved campaign-admission spec/plan. This document does not create a campaign, configuration, admission policy, preview request or launch. P1–P4 source review and updated readiness must finish before principal preparation. Principal chooses all fresh names and paths.

The approved admission spec supersedes the earlier launch-budget note's dynamic stage reserve suggestion: admission checks the settled prior-round prefix, while the common per-role envelope and total-cap invariant cover author/critic continuation without new stage reserve state.

