## Freshness and inspection limits

Do not wholesale-copy actual06 or any earlier root. Exclude all old manifests/scopes/configs/launch files, campaign/round launch or start state, admission state, roles, authorization/ledger/receipt/index/lock files, owner tokens, workspace leases/mount/container/control reservations, checkpoints/archive/records/critics, responses and runtime result files. The only `adapter-blobs` imports described here are the eight exact original parent request/output evidence blobs. No old operational authority or novelty history is inherited.

Inspection used only source text, approved design/plan/readiness evidence and selected actual artifact metadata. No source imports/execution, tests, summaries, campaign/request/policy/capability construction, provider/API/Docker/evaluation/environment/credential access or archive/source mutations occurred. Only this document was written. Tables transcribe accepted references and observed metadata; they are not a new full authentication run or current resource liveness claim.
